          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwana wa Avisua, mwana wa Vineasi, mwana wa Eleasali, mwana wa Aluni, mũthembi mũnene— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esala o ũsu nĩwambatie kuma Mbaviloni. Na aĩ maũndĩki mũmanyi mĩaonĩ ya Mose, ĩla Yeova, Ngai wa Isilaeli, wanenganĩte; na mũsumbĩ amũnenga ũndũ w’onthe ũla wamwĩtĩtye, kwĩanana na kw’oko kwa Yeova Ngai wake ĩũlũ wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
