          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ ũũ nĩw’o wumĩĩsyo wa valũa ũla mũsumbĩ Alitasasita wanengie mũthembi Esala, mũandĩki, o mũandĩki wa ndeto sya mĩao ya Yeova, na wa motw’ĩo make kwa Isilaeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitasasita, mũsumbĩ wa asumbĩ, valũa ũũ wakwa ũmũvikĩe mũthembi Esala, mũandĩki wa mĩao ya Ngai wa ĩtunĩ, mwĩanĩu, nũvoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
